# .env.example  [Secret names, no secret values]
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Purpose   Tell teammates WHICH secrets the project needs, without sharing them
# How       Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env is in .gitignore, this file is committed
# Read by   main.py and api.py at startup (stage 3)
#
# Nothing needed in stage 1. Stage 3 adds, for example, the experiment tracking API key
# and where the API loads the model from
